#: ../../source/tools/pinmux.md:6
msgid "Pinmux Pin Configuration Tool"
msgstr "Pinmux 引脚配置工具"

#: ../../source/tools/pinmux.md:8
msgid "Overview"
msgstr "概述"

#: ../../source/tools/pinmux.md:10
msgid ""
"The Pinmux (Pin Multiplexing) tool is a graphical pin configuration tool "
"provided by UniSDK to help developers visually configure chip pin "
"multiplexing functions in the terminal."
msgstr ""
"Pinmux（引脚复用）工具是 UniSDK 提供的图形化引脚配置工具，帮助开发者在终端中可视化配置芯片引脚复用功能。"

#: ../../source/tools/pinmux.md:12
msgid "**Key Features:**"
msgstr "**主要特性：**"

#: ../../source/tools/pinmux.md:14
msgid "Graphical terminal interface (based on the Textual framework)"
msgstr "图形化终端界面（基于 Textual 框架）"

#: ../../source/tools/pinmux.md:15
msgid "Visual selection of pin functions with interactive popup menus"
msgstr "通过交互式弹出菜单可视化选择引脚功能"

#: ../../source/tools/pinmux.md:16
msgid "Pin configuration conflict detection"
msgstr "引脚配置冲突检测"

#: ../../source/tools/pinmux.md:17
msgid "Requirement validation (ensures all required functions are assigned)"
msgstr "需求验证（确保所有必需功能已分配）"

#: ../../source/tools/pinmux.md:18
msgid "Support for multiple chip package variants"
msgstr "支持多种芯片封装变体"

#: ../../source/tools/pinmux.md:19
msgid "Integration with the Kconfig configuration system"
msgstr "与 Kconfig 配置系统集成"

#: ../../source/tools/pinmux.md:20
msgid "Automatic generation of the `pinmux.h` header file"
msgstr "自动生成 `pinmux.h` 头文件"

#: ../../source/tools/pinmux.md:22
msgid "Launch Methods"
msgstr "启动方式"

#: ../../source/tools/pinmux.md:35
msgid "Main View"
msgstr "主视图"

#: ../../source/tools/pinmux.md:37
msgid "Once opened, you will see the main dashboard:"
msgstr "打开后，您将看到主仪表板："

#: ../../source/tools/pinmux.md:39
msgid ""
"**Ports:** A scrollable vertical list of all GPIO ports (e.g., PORT A, "
"PORT B)"
msgstr "**端口：** 所有 GPIO 口的可滚动垂直列表（例如 PORT A、PORT B）"

#: ../../source/tools/pinmux.md:40
msgid ""
"**Pins:** Inside each port section, individual pins are displayed as "
"interactive buttons showing the pin's name and its currently assigned "
"function"
msgstr "**引脚：** 在每个端口部分内，各个引脚显示为交互式按钮，显示引脚名称及其当前分配的功能"

#: ../../source/tools/pinmux.md:42
msgid ""
"![Pinmux Interface overview](pics/pinmux_1.png) *Figure 1. Pinmux "
"Interface overview showing GPIO ports, pins, and assigned functions.*"
msgstr ""
"![Pinmux 界面概览](pics/pinmux_1.png) *图 1. Pinmux 界面概览，显示 GPIO 端口、引脚和已分配的功能。*"

#: ../../source/tools/pinmux.md:42
msgid "Pinmux Interface overview"
msgstr "Pinmux 界面概览"

#: ../../source/tools/pinmux.md:45
msgid "Selecting a Function"
msgstr "选择功能"

#: ../../source/tools/pinmux.md:47
msgid "Click on a pin (or navigate to it and press **Enter**)"
msgstr "点击引脚（或导航到该引脚并按 **Enter**）"

#: ../../source/tools/pinmux.md:48
msgid "A popup window titled **Function Select** will appear"
msgstr "将弹出一个标题为 **Function Select** 的窗口"

#: ../../source/tools/pinmux.md:49
msgid "The list shows all supported hardware functions for that specific pin"
msgstr "列表显示该特定引脚支持的所有硬件功能"

#: ../../source/tools/pinmux.md:50
msgid ""
"Select the desired function (e.g., `UART0_RX`) or select **NONE** to "
"disable the pin"
msgstr "选择所需功能（例如 `UART0_RX`）或选择 **NONE** 禁用引脚"

#: ../../source/tools/pinmux.md:51
msgid "Press **Enter** to confirm"
msgstr "按 **Enter** 确认"

#: ../../source/tools/pinmux.md:53
msgid ""
"![Function select screen](pics/pinmux_2.png) *Figure 2. Function select "
"screen for a GPIO pin.*"
msgstr ""
"![功能选择界面](pics/pinmux_2.png) *图 2. GPIO 引脚的功能选择界面。*"

#: ../../source/tools/pinmux.md:53
msgid "Function select screen"
msgstr "功能选择界面"

#: ../../source/tools/pinmux.md:56
msgid "Shortcuts"
msgstr "快捷键"

#: ../../source/tools/pinmux.md
msgid "Key"
msgstr "按键"

#: ../../source/tools/pinmux.md
msgid "Action"
msgstr "操作"

#: ../../source/tools/pinmux.md
msgid "**s** (Save)"
msgstr "**s**（保存）"

#: ../../source/tools/pinmux.md
msgid ""
"Validates configuration — checks for conflicts and missing functions. If "
"valid, saves and exits. If invalid, shows an error notification"
msgstr "验证配置 — 检查冲突和缺失功能。如果有效，保存并退出。如果无效，显示错误通知"

#: ../../source/tools/pinmux.md
msgid "**q** (Quit)"
msgstr "**q**（退出）"

#: ../../source/tools/pinmux.md
msgid ""
"Exits the application. A confirmation dialog appears if there are unsaved"
" modifications"
msgstr "退出应用程序。如果有未保存的修改，将显示确认对话框"

#: ../../source/tools/pinmux.md:63
msgid "Validation errors occur when:"
msgstr "验证错误发生在以下情况："

#: ../../source/tools/pinmux.md:64
msgid ""
"Necessary functions are not assigned to pins (e.g., UART0 is enabled but "
"UART0_TX is not assigned)"
msgstr "必需功能未分配给引脚（例如 UART0 已启用但 UART0_TX 未分配）"

#: ../../source/tools/pinmux.md:65
msgid "Conflicting pins exist (e.g., UART0_TX assigned to both PC3 and PC4)"
msgstr "存在引脚冲突（例如 UART0_TX 同时分配给 PC3 和 PC4）"

#: ../../source/tools/pinmux.md:67
msgid "![Exit Screen](pics/pinmux_3.png) *Figure 3. Exit Screen.*"
msgstr "![退出界面](pics/pinmux_3.png) *图 3. 退出界面。*"

#: ../../source/tools/pinmux.md:67
msgid "Exit Screen"
msgstr "退出界面"

#: ../../source/tools/pinmux.md:70
msgid "Saving"
msgstr "保存"

#: ../../source/tools/pinmux.md:72
msgid ""
"The configuration is saved to a file named `<SoC or board name>.<soc or "
"board>.pinmux`. For example, building for TL3218X_EVK generates "
"`TL3218X_EVK.board.pinmux`."
msgstr ""
"配置将保存到名为 `<SoC or board name>.<soc or board>.pinmux` 的文件中。例如，为 TL3218X_EVK 构建将生成 `TL3218X_EVK.board.pinmux`。"

#: ../../source/tools/pinmux.md:74
msgid ""
"This `.pinmux` file contains pin-to-function mappings in a human-readable"
" format and is used to restore previous pin settings when the tool is "
"invoked again."
msgstr ""
"此 `.pinmux` 文件包含人类可读格式的引脚到功能映射，并在再次调用工具时用于恢复先前的引脚设置。"

#: ../../source/tools/pinmux.md:76
msgid ""
"Additionally, `pinmux.h` is generated in the build folder based on the "
"saved settings, containing C preprocessor definitions usable by firmware "
"code."
msgstr ""
"此外，根据保存的设置，在构建文件夹中生成 `pinmux.h`，其中包含固件代码可用的 C 预处理器定义。"

#: ../../source/tools/pinmux.md:78
msgid ""
"The `.pinmux` files persist until the project switches, allowing previous"
" pin settings to be restored when switching between chips."
msgstr "`.pinmux` 文件会持续存在直到项目切换，允许在切换芯片时恢复先前的引脚设置。"

#: ../../source/tools/pinmux.md:80
msgid "File Format"
msgstr "文件格式"

#: ../../source/tools/pinmux.md:82
msgid "The `.pinmux` files use a simple key-value format:"
msgstr "`.pinmux` 文件使用简单的键值格式："

#: ../../source/tools/pinmux.md:90
msgid "Each line represents a single pin assignment"
msgstr "每行代表一个引脚分配"

#: ../../source/tools/pinmux.md:91
msgid "All letters are upper-case"
msgstr "所有字母均为大写"

#: ../../source/tools/pinmux.md:92
msgid "Format: `<pin name>=<function name>`"
msgstr "格式：`<引脚名称>=<功能名称>`"

#: ../../source/tools/pinmux.md:93
msgid "Pin name consists of letter **P**, port letter, and pin number"
msgstr "引脚名称由字母 **P**、端口字母和引脚编号组成"

#: ../../source/tools/pinmux.md:95
msgid "During parsing, the following lines are ignored:"
msgstr "解析过程中，以下行将被忽略："

#: ../../source/tools/pinmux.md:96
msgid "Invalid data that doesn't match the pattern"
msgstr "不符合格式的无效数据"

#: ../../source/tools/pinmux.md:97
msgid "Valid data referencing non-existent pins or functions"
msgstr "引用不存在的引脚或功能的有效数据"

#: ../../source/tools/pinmux.md:98
msgid "Assignments to pins on ports disabled in the current configuration"
msgstr "分配给当前配置中禁用的端口上的引脚"

#: ../../source/tools/pinmux.md:99
msgid "Assignments to functions not enabled in the current configuration"
msgstr "分配给当前配置中未启用的功能"

#: ../../source/tools/pinmux.md:101
msgid "Overriding Mechanism"
msgstr "覆盖机制"

#: ../../source/tools/pinmux.md:103
msgid ""
"Each time pinmux is invoked, data is loaded in the following sequence "
"(each overrides the previous):"
msgstr "每次调用 pinmux 时，数据按以下顺序加载（每个覆盖前一个）："

#: ../../source/tools/pinmux.md:105
msgid ""
"**SoC defaults** — from `soc/<soc>/pinmux/function.yaml` (used for "
"development)"
msgstr "**SoC 默认值** — 来自 `soc/<soc>/pinmux/function.yaml`（用于开发）"

#: ../../source/tools/pinmux.md:106
msgid ""
"**Project `.pinmux`** — in the project directory (sets custom defaults "
"for any chip)"
msgstr "**项目 `.pinmux`** — 在项目目录中（为任意芯片设置自定义默认值）"

#: ../../source/tools/pinmux.md:107
msgid ""
"**`<identifier>.pinmux`** — in the project directory (chip-specific "
"overrides)"
msgstr "**`<identifier>.pinmux`** — 在项目目录中（芯片特定覆盖）"

#: ../../source/tools/pinmux.md:108
msgid ""
"**`<identifier>.pinmux`** — in the build directory (last actual user pin "
"settings)"
msgstr "**`<identifier>.pinmux`** — 在构建目录中（上次实际用户引脚设置）"

#: ../../source/tools/pinmux.md:110
msgid ""
"This allows projects to have out-of-the-box pin settings while still "
"allowing customization."
msgstr "这使得项目可以拥有开箱即用的引脚设置，同时仍允许自定义。"

#: ../../source/tools/pinmux.md:112
msgid "Internal Execution Flow"
msgstr "内部执行流程"

#: ../../source/tools/pinmux.md:114
msgid "Data Loading & Synchronization"
msgstr "数据加载与同步"

#: ../../source/tools/pinmux.md:116
msgid "When the application starts, it combines multiple data sources:"
msgstr "当应用程序启动时，它会合并多个数据源："

#: ../../source/tools/pinmux.md:118
msgid ""
"`soc/<soc>/pinmux/function.yaml` — The \"Function Definitions\": "
"describes all available functions for the chip"
msgstr ""
"`soc/<soc>/pinmux/function.yaml` — \"功能定义\"：描述芯片的所有可用功能"

#: ../../source/tools/pinmux.md:119
msgid ""
"`soc/<soc>/pinmux/pinmux.yaml` — The \"Dictionary\": lists every physical"
" pin and its supported functions. Each port can have an `exclude` "
"property, which describes what functions aren't supported by its pins. "
"Individual pins can also use `exclude` and `include` properties. The "
"restrictions are applied in the following order: port's exclude → pin's "
"exclude → pin's include. For simplicity, the `all` keyword represents all"
" functions. For groups of functions, you may use a group name (e.g., "
"`uart0` represents `uart0_tx`, `uart0_rx`, `uart0_cts`, and `uart0_rts`; "
"`uart` covers `uart0`, `uart1`, etc.). If a pin supports only one exact "
"function, use `exclude: all` together with `include: your_function`."
msgstr ""
"`soc/<soc>/pinmux/pinmux.yaml` — \"字典\"：列出每个物理引脚及其支持的功能。每个端口可以有一个 `exclude` 属性，描述其引脚不支持哪些功能。单个引脚也可以使用 `exclude` 和 `include` 属性。限制按以下顺序应用：端口的 exclude → 引脚的 exclude → 引脚的 include。为简化起见，`all` 关键字表示所有功能。对于功能组，可以使用组名称（例如 `uart0` 代表 `uart0_tx`、`uart0_rx`、`uart0_cts` 和 `uart0_rts`；`uart` 涵盖 `uart0`、`uart1` 等）。如果某个引脚仅支持一个确切功能，请使用 `exclude: all` 配合 `include: your_function`。"

#: ../../source/tools/pinmux.md:120
msgid ""
"`soc/<soc>/pinmux/pinmux_<case>.yaml` — The \"Restriction\": overrides "
"`pinmux.yaml` to remove pins or ports for specific chip packages by "
"assigning the `delete` keyword"
msgstr ""
"`soc/<soc>/pinmux/pinmux_<case>.yaml` — \"限制\"：通过分配 `delete` 关键字覆盖 `pinmux.yaml`，以移除特定芯片封装的引脚或端口"

#: ../../source/tools/pinmux.md:121
msgid ""
"`.config` — The \"Requirements\": tells the app which drivers are enabled"
" (e.g., \"UART0 is enabled, so we need pins for TX and RX\")"
msgstr ""
"`.config` — \"需求\"：告知应用程序哪些驱动已启用（例如 \"UART0 已启用，因此我们需要 TX 和 RX 的引脚\"）"

#: ../../source/tools/pinmux.md:122
msgid "`.pinmux` files — Previous user configurations (see overriding mechanism)"
msgstr "`.pinmux` 文件 — 之前的用户配置（参见覆盖机制）"

#: ../../source/tools/pinmux.md:124
msgid "**The Loading Sequence:**"
msgstr "**加载顺序：**"

#: ../../source/tools/pinmux.md:126
msgid ""
"The `.config` file, which contains the current configuration and "
"identifies the current chip."
msgstr "`.config` 文件，包含当前配置并标识当前芯片。"

#: ../../source/tools/pinmux.md:127
msgid ""
"The function description from `function.yaml`, skipping functions "
"disabled by configuration."
msgstr "来自 `function.yaml` 的功能描述，跳过配置中禁用的功能。"

#: ../../source/tools/pinmux.md:128
msgid ""
"The port and pin description from `pinmux.yaml` and `pinmux_<case>.yaml` "
"for the selected chip."
msgstr "来自选定芯片的 `pinmux.yaml` 和 `pinmux_<case>.yaml` 的端口和引脚描述。"

#: ../../source/tools/pinmux.md:129
msgid ""
"The `.pinmux` files in the order described in the [Overriding Mechanism"
"](#overriding-mechanism) section."
msgstr "按照[覆盖机制](#overriding-mechanism)部分描述的顺序加载 `.pinmux` 文件。"

#: ../../source/tools/pinmux.md:131
msgid "Changing a Pin Function"
msgstr "更改引脚功能"

#: ../../source/tools/pinmux.md:133
msgid ""
"When a new function is selected for a pin, the following happens "
"instantly:"
msgstr "当一个引脚选择新功能时，将立即发生以下操作："

#: ../../source/tools/pinmux.md:135
msgid ""
"**Collision Check:** The system scans all other pins. If you try to "
"assign a unique function (like `UART0_TX`) to PC0, but PB2 already has "
"it, the system flags a **Conflict**."
msgstr ""
"**冲突检查：** 系统扫描所有其他引脚。如果您尝试将唯一功能（如 `UART0_TX`）分配给 PC0，但 PB2 已拥有该功能，系统会标记 **冲突**。"

#: ../../source/tools/pinmux.md:136
msgid "**Observer Update:** The app uses an \"Observer Pattern.\""
msgstr "**观察者更新：** 应用程序使用\"观察者模式\"。"

#: ../../source/tools/pinmux.md:137
msgid "The Pin data changes."
msgstr "引脚数据发生更改。"

#: ../../source/tools/pinmux.md:138
msgid ""
"The UI widget receives a notification and redraws itself (updating the "
"text and color)."
msgstr "UI 小部件收到通知并重新绘制自身（更新文本和颜色）。"

#: ../../source/tools/pinmux.md:139
msgid ""
"The next `is_modified` property access in `PinmuxManager` will return "
"`True`, until the save action is triggered."
msgstr "下一次在 `PinmuxManager` 中访问 `is_modified` 属性将返回 `True`，直到触发保存操作。"

#: ../../source/tools/pinmux.md:141
msgid "The Saving Process"
msgstr "保存过程"

#: ../../source/tools/pinmux.md:143
msgid ""
"When you press Save (`s`), the app performs strict validation before "
"writing to disk."
msgstr "当您按下保存（`s`）时，应用程序在写入磁盘前执行严格验证。"

#: ../../source/tools/pinmux.md:145
msgid "**Step 1: Validation**"
msgstr "**第 1 步：验证**"

#: ../../source/tools/pinmux.md:147
msgid ""
"**Check Conflicts:** Are two pins assigned to the same non-repeatable "
"function? If yes → Error."
msgstr "**检查冲突：** 是否有两个引脚分配到同一个不可重复的功能？如果是 → 报错。"

#: ../../source/tools/pinmux.md:148
msgid ""
"**Check Requirements:** Are all functions required by the configuration "
"assigned to valid pins? If no → Error."
msgstr "**检查需求：** 配置所需的所有功能是否已分配给有效的引脚？如果否 → 报错。"

#: ../../source/tools/pinmux.md:150
msgid "**Step 2: Writing**"
msgstr "**第 2 步：写入**"

#: ../../source/tools/pinmux.md:152
msgid ""
"If there are no errors, the pin mapping is saved to the "
"`<identifier>.pinmux` file using the simple key-value format."
msgstr ""
"如果没有错误，引脚映射将使用简单的键值格式保存到 `<identifier>.pinmux` 文件中。"

#: ../../source/tools/pinmux.md:154
msgid "Generating pinmux.h"
msgstr "生成 pinmux.h"

#: ../../source/tools/pinmux.md:156
msgid ""
"After saving, `pinmux.h` is automatically generated with C preprocessor "
"definitions:"
msgstr "保存后，`pinmux.h` 将自动生成 C 预处理器定义："

#: ../../source/tools/pinmux.md:168
msgid "Configuration File Locations"
msgstr "配置文件位置"

#: ../../source/tools/pinmux.md
msgid "Pinmux Configuration Files"
msgstr "Pinmux 配置文件"

#: ../../source/tools/pinmux.md:183
msgid "Build Integration"
msgstr "构建集成"

#: ../../source/tools/pinmux.md:185
msgid "Pinmux configuration is deeply integrated into the build system:"
msgstr "Pinmux 配置深度集成到构建系统中："

#: ../../source/tools/pinmux.md:187
msgid ""
"The `generate_pinmux` CMake target automatically executes before "
"compilation"
msgstr "`generate_pinmux` CMake 目标在编译前自动执行"

#: ../../source/tools/pinmux.md:188
msgid ""
"Pre-build checks automatically detect whether `pinmux.h` needs to be "
"updated"
msgstr "预构建检查自动检测 `pinmux.h` 是否需要更新"

#: ../../source/tools/pinmux.md:189
msgid ""
"The generated `pinmux.h` is placed in the `build/` directory and "
"automatically added to the include path"
msgstr "生成的 `pinmux.h` 放置在 `build/` 目录中，并自动添加到包含路径"

#: ../../source/tools/pinmux.md:191
msgid "CI"
msgstr "CI"

#: ../../source/tools/pinmux.md:193
msgid ""
"The CI uses a single configuration across all samples. This is possible "
"because unused assignments are skipped, so you just need to consider all "
"pin usages in the samples within this file. Before the build, the CI "
"copies this file to the build directory. Since the build's settings are "
"applied last during overriding, the resulting configuration corresponds "
"to what is described in the file — all previous settings are overridden."
msgstr ""
"CI 在所有示例中使用单一配置。这是可行的，因为未使用的分配会被跳过，因此您只需考虑此文件中所有示例的引脚使用情况。在构建之前，CI 将此文件复制到构建目录。由于构建设置会在覆盖过程中最后应用，因此最终配置与文件中描述的配置一致 — 所有先前的设置均被覆盖。"
